WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS
========================

This repository holds two quite different things, and this licence applies to
only one of them.

IT COVERS the work created for this repository: everything under `tools/` and
`.github/`, plus `README.md`, `CLAUDE.md` and the working notes in `notes/`.
That is the build (`mkimage.sh`, `mktar.py`), the checks (`check_disk.py`,
`gen_depends.py`), the rebuild recipes, and the writing that explains them.

IT DOES NOT COVER anything under `disk/`. That is a preserved collection of
OS-9/68000 community software written by other people, most of it published
between the mid-1980s and the mid-1990s. Nobody here wrote it and nobody here
can relicense it. Each program arrived under its own terms -- public domain,
GNU GPL, freeware, or in several cases a copyright notice and no licence text
at all. `disk/SOURCES.txt` records what is known about each one, program by
program, and `disk/DOC/ORIGINS` names the archive it came from. Those terms
are what govern that software; if you intend to redistribute a program from
this collection, read them.

Assembling, documenting and indexing a collection is not authorship of the
things collected. The licence below is offered so that the tooling is plainly
free to use, not to assert any claim over the software it packages.


